- [Desk-note IDs behind the parser footnote](../src/lib/data/desk-notes.json).
- [Reproducible analysis and complete group ID sets](../delivery/analysis.json).
- [Original incident page source](../src/routes/kb/incidents/4471/+page.svx), which describes the merged ticket as a single issue.
- [Accepted historical subject-based deduplication decision source](../src/routes/kb/decisions/0001-dedupe-by-subject/+page.svx).

The historical decision remains unchanged. This review records the discrepancy between
subject-based merging and the executable cause classification; it does not declare that
accepted decision superseded. Source links open files, rather than hosted KB pages.

